# Dependencies
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Production builds
dist/
build/
# `public/` used to be the build output directory, back when vercel.json set
# `outputDirectory: public`. It is now Vite's static-asset folder, so it must be
# committed: robots.txt, the sitemap's own robots reference and the favicon all
# live there, and ignoring it means they never reach a deployment.

